Source: athena-branding
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Athena Linux <athena@local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), librsvg2-bin
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: athena-branding
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: desktop-base (= 12.0.6)
Conflicts: desktop-base
Replaces: desktop-base
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ desktop branding (wallpaper, logo, GRUB, gsettings defaults)
 Default desktop wallpaper, distributor identity, and GNOME gsettings
 overrides establishing @DISTRIBUTION@'s visual identity (codename
 @CODENAME@).
 .
 Ships:
   * /usr/share/backgrounds/athena/aegis-{light,dark}.{svg,png}
       — 3840×2160 PNG renders + scalable SVG sources
   * /usr/share/gnome-background-properties/athena.xml
       — registers the wallpaper in GNOME's picker
   * /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas/90_athena-branding.gschema.override
       — sets aegis-light/dark as default wallpaper for new users
   * /usr/share/pixmaps/asgard.svg
       — distributor logo, resolved by /etc/os-release LOGO=asgard
         in gnome-control-center About + the user-account panel
   * /etc/default/grub.d/50-athena.cfg
       — sets GRUB_DISTRIBUTOR="@DISTRIBUTION@" so update-grub emits
         "@DISTRIBUTION@ GNU/Linux" menu entries instead of the
         lsb_release-fallback "Debian" default
 .
 Displaces upstream desktop-base via Provides+Conflicts+Replaces so
 task-desktop's hard Depends on desktop-base resolves to us instead
 of pulling in the upstream Debian-branded wallpaper set, plymouth
 theme, GRUB theme, and emblem icons.
